OL,3,GNEWSAGirls used Penny Bazaar jobs to
OL,4,Asupport families
OL,5,
OL,6,FStories of some of the first women to
OL,7,Fwork at the last surviving Marks &
OL,8,FSpencer Penny Bazaar have been revealed
OL,9,Fin new research.
OL,11,FEvidence uncovered by a family history
OL,12,Fwebsite has found young working-class
OL,13,Fwomen used jobs at the shop in the
OL,14,FGrainger Market, Newcastle-upon-Tyne,
OL,15,Fto support their families and overcome
OL,16,Fhardship during the early 20th Century.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,397,390,260,160,0,100
