OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAGirls used Penny Bazaar jobs to
OL,4,Asupport families
OL,5,
OL,6,FResearchers traced employees of the
OL,7,FPenny Bazaar, which opened in 1895,
OL,8,Fthrough census returns, birth and
OL,9,Fmarriage records and newspaper archives
OL,10,Fand found some girls as young as 15
OL,11,Fwere working there to support their
OL,12,Ffamilies.
OL,14,FA spokesperson from the site Findmypast
OL,15,Fsaid "the biggest influence on our
OL,16,Fcommunities comes from ordinary
OL,17,Fpeople".
